      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "39451FFFAE9CE4EE",
      "text": "呵呵……\\n很高兴听到你这句话。\\c\\n请你今后也要在我们的帕底亚\\n引领人们向前迈进。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
