      "label": "coach_paldea_top_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "638FCBE20AE3DFC6",
      "text": "模仿宝可梦联盟的社团，\\n这个想法真的十分耐人寻味。\\c\\n让我和克拉韦尔商量一下，\\n看能不能把同样的事也导入学院吧。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
