    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "638FCCE20AE3E179",
      "text": "我也曾多次\\n造访零区研究所。\\c\\n但完全没想到要将\\n蓝之光碟放进入口的面板内。\\c\\n呵呵……你果然是个\\n能轻易超出我想象的人。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
