    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "638FC9E20AE3DC60",
      "text": "蓝莓学园的入口很有独创性，\\n设计得非常巧妙。\\c\\n当然，我认为学院的入口\\n也毫不逊色就是了。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
