    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "638FCAE20AE3DE13",
      "text": "冠军[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你\\n交换给我的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]……\\c\\n它和你很像，\\n拥有了不起的才能。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
